  - nodeId: 1
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: The metallic chime of gold coins deafened you, filling your ears with the
      shrill whine of desire.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 2
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: "You slipped another token into the slot machine and pulled its beckoning
      lever, watching the symbols spin\u2014icons of vice painted by artists for
      soulless hotels."
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 3
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: The throb of techno music and the bodies dancing somewhere in the distance
      blurred your thoughts, yet all you could do was wait for three axes to line
      up and punish your sister, Temperance, with their sharpened blades.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 4
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Then they did.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 5
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: They carved deep gashes across her belly, sheared away every strand of
      her graying hair, and you rejoiced as your winnings tripled.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 6
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Counting your crumpled bills, you finally forgot the day you told yourself
      that the smell of the walls alone would be enough to keep you alive.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 7
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Well? The mist is finally lifting from your memories, isn't it?
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
